{"chapter":"a1-33-saetze-verbinden","level":"A1","number":33,"title":"Sätze verbinden","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Kommst du heute ins Kino Jonas","speaker":"Carla","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-33-saetze-verbinden","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Nein ich kann heute nicht denn ich arbeite lange","speaker":"Jonas","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-33-saetze-verbinden","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Oh Wie lange arbeitest du","speaker":"Carla","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-33-saetze-verbinden","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Bis acht Uhr Der Film beginnt um sieben also komme ich nicht","speaker":"Jonas","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-33-saetze-verbinden","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Ach so Das ist schade Aber wir haben morgen auch Zeit oder","speaker":"Carla","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-33-saetze-verbinden","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Ja morgen habe ich frei Wir haben genug Zeit denn der Film läuft morgen auch","speaker":"Jonas","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-33-saetze-verbinden","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":7,"text":"Super Dann gehen wir morgen Ich kaufe die Karten","speaker":"Carla","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-33-saetze-verbinden","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":8,"text":"Danke Aber ich bezahle den Kaffee denn du kaufst die Karten","speaker":"Jonas","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-33-saetze-verbinden","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":9,"text":"Perfekt Also m